%% NockLock — Fence Flow
%% What `nocklock wrap -- <agent>` does, in order. Every fence is set up before
%% the child starts; any setup failure refuses to start (fail closed).

flowchart TD
    A["nocklock wrap -- claude ..."] --> B["1. Load .nock/config.toml<br/>(walk up from cwd; none → error: run nocklock init,<br/>unless --profile)<br/>strict TOML: unknown key = error"]
    B --> C["2. Open audit log OUTSIDE the project<br/>$XDG_STATE_HOME/nocklock/&lt;project-key&gt;/events.db<br/>sign config.digest row"]
    C --> D["3. Secret fence<br/>block list wins, then pass list<br/>optional preflight scan of paths + env"]
    D --> E{"4. Filesystem fence"}
    E -->|Linux| E1["Landlock ruleset<br/>+ LD_PRELOAD libfence_fs.so (events)"]
    E -->|macOS| E2["Seatbelt profile: writes confined to root,<br/>sensitive paths denied<br/>validated with sandbox-exec"]
    E1 --> F
    E2 --> F
    F{"5. Syscall fence<br/>(enforcement = required by default)"}
    F -->|Linux| F1["seccomp: EPERM denylist<br/>(mount, ptrace, bpf, unshare, ...)<br/>+ allowed socket families"]
    F -->|macOS| F2["hardened SBPL rules: deny mach-priv-host-port,<br/>iokit-open, system-socket; limit /dev writes"]
    F1 --> G
    F2 --> G
    G{"6. Network fence"}
    G -->|default| G1["allowlist proxy<br/>HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY<br/>(Linux+seccomp: AF_UNIX bridge via LD_PRELOAD)"]
    G -->|"--net-fence=netns (Linux)"| G2["root helper via sudo -n:<br/>new netns, nftables default-drop,<br/>tproxy + DNS stub, drop caps, exec agent"]
    G1 --> H
    G2 --> H
    H["7. Agent starts exactly once<br/>filtered env, stdio passes through"]
    H --> I["Every allow / deny → signed audit row<br/>(optional: forward to Command ops log)"]
    I --> J["8. Agent exits<br/>write chain-anchor.json; push off-box if NOCKLOCK_ANCHOR_URL set<br/>nocklock exits with the agent's exit code"]

    B -. fails .-> X
    C -. fails .-> X
    D -. "finding or fails" .-> X
    E -. fails .-> X
    F -. fails .-> X
    G -. fails .-> X
    X["Refuse to start<br/>agent never runs, nonzero exit"]

    classDef refused stroke:#F87171,stroke-width:2px
    classDef running stroke:#10B981,stroke-width:2px
    class X refused
    class H running
